\section{Introduction}
The RC subteam wants to implement an on board localization system. To do this, a "poor man's lidar" system will be created out of four time of flight distance sensors placed on each side of the car. The sensors will report distance to the track walls in each of the 4 directions, as shown in Figure \ref{fig:LidarSetup}. "Particle Filters: A Hands-On Tutorial" ("the paper") provides an overview of particle filters a practical guide for implementing them and is the paper I followed when creating this one \cite{partFiltTutorial}.
